Deploying to GitHub Pages:                                                                                                                                                        
                                                                                                                                                                                    
  1. Create a GitHub repo (e.g. spectra-site) and push this folder to it
  2. Enable Pages via Actions: repo Settings → Pages → Source → "GitHub Actions"                                                                                                    
  3. Push to main — the workflow at .github/workflows/jekyll.yml builds and deploys automatically                                                                                   
                                                                                                                                                                                    
  Update _config.yml with your real username:                                                                                                                                       
  url: "https://YOUR_USERNAME.github.io"                                                                                                                                            
  baseurl: "/spectra-site"   # or "" if the repo is named YOUR_USERNAME.github.io
                                                                                                                                                                                    
  Adding new docs — just create a Markdown file in _docs/:                                                                                                                          
  _docs/my-new-page.md                                                                                                                                                              
  With frontmatter at the top:                                                                                                                                                      
                                                                                                                                                                                    
  ---                                                       
  title: My New Page                                                                                                                                                                
  category: reference                                       
  ---                                                                                                                                                                               
     
  Your content here...                                                                                                                                                              
  Push to main, the Action rebuilds, it appears at /docs/my-new-page/ automatically. Same pattern for _posts/ (blog) and _usecases/.

